 "toplevel": "File header lists the extracted fields; HRV is omitted. The delegate keeps <trkpt>s and <rtept>s separately (points = track, else route), tracks the open-element path, takes the first <type> directly under <trk>/<rte> as trkType, and <metadata><time>. GPXImporter is @MainActor so XML parsing runs on the main actor.",
